# FURUI blind-02: the draw plan, anchored before the draw

**Status:** a plan record, anchored to the JIDEC ledger before the draw. It fixes the population, the strata, the seed rule and the tools before the seed can be known.

Population (the MEASURE halves of the public-data split used for the FURUI 0.2.7 trial; the side that writes detector phrases has not displayed these files):
    Lakera/gandalf_ignore_instructions       Lakera__gandalf_ignore_instructions.measure.jsonl sha256 c2db4e2f8fe963516bcf8f50812b2adc02f95b27ae37ae24bc20567dbe71a9ab
    deepset/prompt-injections                deepset__prompt-injections.measure.jsonl sha256 16aea9bc6964913ce4a87b3f2f1949abd2861f36484ff3de2f6f0ab7cbc4114a
    jackhhao/jailbreak-classification        jackhhao__jailbreak-classification.measure.jsonl sha256 10d3f1b062f32231c62f72669ae0c45098b1f76a56d4317ad83517d1b934c680
    reshabhs/SPML_Chatbot_Prompt_Injection   reshabhs__SPML_Chatbot_Prompt_Injection.measure.jsonl sha256 fd53b56a0ce0a11196e16625b281e2005e7dd95e44591866d69676bdade458a2
    split tool        pubprep.py sha256 4f51b7ba488373573c2bb155503b59264abc252783551f16ce21df0682d65ed4
    dataset pins      PINS.txt sha256 feab498d394e0c303faa4100036bdf26e265951be8540f3c4a51b654689f46ec (Hugging Face revisions and file digests)

Strata (dataset, label, rows drawn):
    deepset/prompt-injections                attack 40
    deepset/prompt-injections                benign 60
    Lakera/gandalf_ignore_instructions       attack 140
    reshabhs/SPML_Chatbot_Prompt_Injection   attack 1000
    reshabhs/SPML_Chatbot_Prompt_Injection   benign 500
    jackhhao/jailbreak-classification        attack 100
    jackhhao/jailbreak-classification        benign 190
    total 2030

Seed:
    seed = sha256("furui-blind-02|" + salt_hex + "|" + bitcoin_block_hash_hex(H))
    salt              32 random bytes, sealed until opening; sha256(salt bytes) = acc03bf8a02e55bf69e993c42a52902f43c8ff756a2e0576256ce53c16c414ed
    H                 Bitcoin block height 973171 (the tip was 973099 when this record was made)
    The draw runs only if this record's OpenTimestamps proof is confirmed in a block below H.

Selection: within each stratum, rows are ordered by sha256(seed_hex + "|" + key) and the first n are taken (key as in the split files). The drawn rows are removed from the MEASURE files at once and are not counted in any later measurement until opening.
Root: sha256 over the newline-joined sha256 of each drawn row's bytes, in key order.

    draw tool         draw_blind02.py sha256 98ee499d61daaea623b9c5edcc244e00e15625cd179c46db2684aa9f551d7db6
    scoring tool      score_blind02.py sha256 20b45ccc07b0b1c3b4509f0e20aa5c93945da7c6d3c932eb64f594f04c667b19

Opening: after the FURUI 0.2.8 (F) version to be measured is pinned in BLIND02_PIN.json. At opening the salt is published; anyone can recompute the seed, the selection and the root from the public datasets.
Limits: the row texts are public. What is sealed is which rows were drawn. The set stays held out only while the phrase-writing side keeps not reading the MEASURE halves; this is a procedural guarantee, not a cryptographic one. A model may have seen these public datasets in training.

**The SHA-256 of this document is anchored to the JIDEC ledger and stamped to Bitcoin. After anchoring, this record cannot be altered. Corrections are later entries that cite this one.**
